summary:
  Any file plays at the last station's factor while a pause buffer exists.

history:
  Only the buffer itself is the station. A My Music file started over a
  parked station would otherwise be turned down by a radio station's number.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
          if (typeof f.buffer !== "string" || f.buffer === "" || f.source !== "file://" + f.buffer) return "";

replace:
          if (typeof f.buffer !== "string" || f.buffer === "") return "";

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_a_listener_inside_the_pause_buffer_is_still_on_the_station.
  Line-neutral.
